after:
This panel starts light and changes when dark mode is preferred.
```css
.panel {
  color-scheme: light;
  background: white;
  color: black;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  .panel {
    color-scheme: dark;
    background: #17212b;
    color: white;
  }
}
```
